{"title":"Food and Drink","puid":"c-eng-2-gb/33sdzd","path":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-11-celebrations/block-03-birthday-party/level-02","type":"normal","keyboardLayout":"standardNATENG","voiceLang":"en","voice":"m2_2025","instruction":{"voice":"f3_2025","speaker":true},"trainers":[{"trainer":"content","design":"dialogue","instruction":{"text":"Listen."},"textAlign":"left","soundMode":"b","atoms":[{"text":"","sound":"Hi Dad, please can you take me to the supermarket? I need to buy some things for my party on Saturday.","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"f2_chirp","position":"left","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/students/mei.lsg"}},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"","sound":"Of course, we can go later tonight. But first, you need to make a list of the items that you want to buy.","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"m1_chirp","position":"right","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-11-celebrations/block-03-birthday-party/lsg/02/mei_dad.lsg"}},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"","sound":"Hmm... well I definitely want a birthday cake. Normally, I like carrot cake, but for a party I think chocolate would be better.","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"f2_chirp","position":"left","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/students/mei.lsg"}},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"","sound":"Okay, and what about some snacks? Maybe it would be nice to get some fruit like apples or bananas for everyone to share.","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"m1_chirp","position":"right","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-11-celebrations/block-03-birthday-party/lsg/02/mei_dad.lsg"}},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"","sound":"Yes, great idea! I’ll buy some apples, but I don’t really like bananas, so I’ll get some oranges instead.","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"f2_chirp","position":"left","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/students/mei.lsg"}},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"","sound":"Okay, that’s the snacks sorted, but what about for dinner? I could make burgers for everyone.","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"m1_chirp","position":"right","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-11-celebrations/block-03-birthday-party/lsg/02/mei_dad.lsg"}},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"","sound":"Well, Reece is vegan and Norr doesn’t eat meat either, but we can buy veggie burgers and some chips too!","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"f2_chirp","position":"left","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/students/mei.lsg"}},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"","sound":"If Reece is vegan, you will have to make sure that the chocolate cake is as well!","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"m1_chirp","position":"right","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-11-celebrations/block-03-birthday-party/lsg/02/mei_dad.lsg"}},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"","sound":"Yes, that’s true. Thank you for reminding me.","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"f2_chirp","position":"left","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/students/mei.lsg"}}]},{"trainer":"multipleChoice","instruction":"Choose.","soundMode":"a","shuffleButtons":true,"onSamePageOnce":true,"atoms":[{"a":"What cake does Mei want for her party?","sound":"What cake does May want for her party?","b":["She wants a carrot cake.","She wants a fruit cake.","++She wants a chocolate cake."]},{"a":"What does Mei’s dad offer to make for everyone?","sound":"What does May’s dad offer to make for everyone?","b":["He offers to make hot dogs.","++He offers to make burgers.","He offers to make cookies."]},{"a":"Why does Mei suggest veggie burgers?","sound":"Why does May suggest veggie burgers","b":["She suggests them because she is vegan.","She suggests them because she doesn’t like them.","++She suggests them because Noor and Rhys don’t eat meat."]}]},{"trainer":"kidCards","shuffleAtoms":true,"shuffleCards":false,"onSamePage":true,"cards":[{"id":1,"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-11-celebrations/block-03-birthday-party/lsg/02/cake.lsg"},{"id":2,"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-11-celebrations/block-03-birthday-party/lsg/0