,"voice":"f2_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/students/mei.lsg"}},{"a":"Okay. Do you know what your friends would like?","b":"Okay. Do you know what your friends would ((++like))?","voice":"m1_chirp","position":"right","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-11-celebrations/block-03-birthday-party/lsg/02/mei_dad.lsg"}},{"a":"Yes, I asked them yesterday at school and wrote their answers down on some paper.","b":"Yes, I asked them yesterday at ((++school)) and wrote their answers down on some paper.","lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-11-celebrations/block-03-birthday-party/lsg/02/drink_tally.lsg","voice":"f2_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/students/mei.lsg"}},{"a":"Oh, that was a great idea Mei! I would suggest that you only buy the two most popular options.","sound":"Oh, that was a great idea May! I suggest that you only buy the two most popular options.","b":"Oh, that was a great idea Mei! I suggest that you only buy the ((++two ++2)) most popular options.","voice":"m1_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-11-celebrations/block-03-birthday-party/lsg/02/mei_dad.lsg"}}]},{"trainer":"imageButtons","onSamePage":true,"instruction":{"text":"Which <b>two</b> drinks should Mei buy?","sound":"Which two drinks should May buy?"},"lsg":{"width":150},"shuffleButtons":true,"atoms":{"b":[{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-11-celebrations/block-03-birthday-party/lsg/02/cola.lsg","correct":true},{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-11-celebrations/block-03-birthday-party/lsg/02/orange_juice.lsg","correct":true},{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-11-celebrations/block-03-birthday-party/lsg/02/apple_juice.lsg"},{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-11-celebrations/block-03-birthday-party/lsg/02/milk.lsg"}]}}],"parentTopic":{"title":"Celebrations","path":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-11-celebrations/topic","puid":"c-eng-2-gb/pkr96r"},"parentBlock":{"title":"The Birthday Party","path":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-11-celebrations/block-03-birthday-party/block","puid":"c-eng-2-gb/y5imql"},"mediaFiles":{"so